#: scenario:scenario_8704C58B_AB93_4596_BBC1_66E75D5316AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 483712d46de3f982aacc351e1aaceb368a5354293c2e34f93c334f38493a3202
#. default-sha256: 9c0397195e9356ab33a0e77901c644bd8cb1b0ed24e3481f0035a0fef577c22e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8704C58B_AB93_4596_BBC1_66E75D5316AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Despite his near devastation by Nellie’s news, "
"Mell’s flaxen eyes continued to wander in hopes of catching sight of the girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Nonostante lo sconforto derivato dalle notizie "
"di Nellie, gli occhi di Mell continuarono a vagare nella speranza di scorgere la ragazza."

#: scenario:scenario_D0630667_6F6E_43B0_886B_90F487AC79B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a50a133783e806e5802ac7dc269a9b8ab442dbd05f9ce36c9860a9efe593527
#. default-sha256: 78973c373f6dc6481e72b9315fe4500b0245a2db8116bed0bd58100574c439a5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D0630667_6F6E_43B0_886B_90F487AC79B5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehehe. By now, it should be quite obvious to you what Mell was feeling."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehehe. A questo punto, Padrone, dovrebbe esserle abbastanza ovvio ciò che Mell stava "
"provando."

#: scenario:scenario_7868E1A0_F1CD_4C90_BC60_7BC0506FCD53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fedcaccf3fce54edb9b541bafefd432ea1c0fffb5234c55af51161e107af5d4
#. default-sha256: 9f32b4af716589a3a47d8b792e51862a15e5b51d3f767afe72c28e7feeeab3fc
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7868E1A0_F1CD_4C90_BC60_7BC0506FCD53"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the boy himself was having difficulty comprehending the things going through his heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma il ragazzo stesso aveva difficoltà a comprendere cosa stesse accadendo al proprio cuore."

#: scenario:scenario_A2AA97D9_98B1_494F_A442_D2BEE9D8F412
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edd225daa99ee4bdb4af479ea98cac42827591323d7fe84ca039648a1819ac71
#. default-sha256: fb70c885382e93d2442c2faa61f46b2752c46d92ade68317b9d52b50d313c6f7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A2AA97D9_98B1_494F_A442_D2BEE9D8F412"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Emotionally, he was horribly unstable—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like a ship without a sail."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Emotivamente, era terribilmente instabile—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫come una nave senza vela."

#: scenario:scenario_3EBFB244_2EA1_43F8_8C68_EC6138002F24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b40d8e374a625957af73ea57c57d62621660cd5c81c8cf16f6e2a847bfb040e
#. default-sha256: 82ee068883f641a547caa216ef62c37c25367b4a77bce89e1345f2986e39032c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3EBFB244_2EA1_43F8_8C68_EC6138002F24"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And still, every time he spotted the White-Haired Girl, his heart would leap, his whole body "
"jitter with anxiety and excitement."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eppure, ogni volta che individuava la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi,⟪k:1⟫il suo cuore "
"sobbalzava, e il suo intero corpo tremava per l’ansia e l’eccitazione."

#: scenario:scenario_880A9A00_6178_4781_9CAE_6D9A9E746C5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc1298ed9899d11ed48859204860a95fdb5cf064e05d71687955bac369376052
#. default-sha256: 4e5097a7a2bcb0217d72f28593429e3c1b9311b5fffae198c223da4d2b598b23
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_880A9A00_6178_4781_9CAE_6D9A9E746C5D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had never felt anything like this before, and as such, he struggled to keep these strange "
"emotions in check."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non aveva mai provato nulla di simile prima di allora, e per questo motivo, doveva lottare "
"per tenere sotto controllo quelle strane emozioni."

#: scenario:scenario_20A1CE6F_59BF_4E47_835D_99D923F40EB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d54fe74049968a8566d32068beb7b8e2bbd97bd9cd663956bb4cb79e6d19dd5d
#. default-sha256: e065ab7310cbc43b015e1ed4eec515b80cd2afd38f447c9c3f1d976334dd3f78
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_20A1CE6F_59BF_4E47_835D_99D923F40EB5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Whenever he saw an opportunity, Mell would speak to the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ogni volta che vedeva un’opportunità, Mell si faceva avanti per parlare con la Ragazza dai "
"Capelli Bianchi."

#: scenario:scenario_09E6D0B3_1622_4C92_8AF7_B90D012C79C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebdd3766f35a9b994deda5c296873aac134bb5a74124c855a8ee41d3f6dbf2e8
#. default-sha256: deba4fa2678a88bf612930b9a849be23234f4e074645b18a54cd57d4d7ba9fbb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_09E6D0B3_1622_4C92_8AF7_B90D012C79C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And days he was unable to, he either spent in secluded silence or a distracted daze."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E nei giorni in cui non era in grado di farlo, rimaneva o in silenzio⟪k:1⟫o in stato "
"confusionale."

#: scenario:scenario_3C246038_1524_4A89_9D60_2B80428E516B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0742d65d7380f0984210dceee32aee39b8eef73c7c53256c905d3d9b0f59bc61
#. default-sha256: 5860b1d0ee7b66ba0efd13b05232f92fd185c0124b37c7bc01e485256c17a698
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3C246038_1524_4A89_9D60_2B80428E516B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Love is a curious thing.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It has the power to change those who experience it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’amore è davvero singolare...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ha il potere di cambiare coloro che lo provano."

#: scenario:scenario_2A9CAE48_B5C8_4E32_B208_816384729909
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f1c2c55fa57578d09c34cc155095093bedd5683592b90676bca6cb9f5bed2b6
#. default-sha256: 09158be5e26db088538dc7bde6e4578117e5fa8388a846368ba13ec1170af51c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2A9CAE48_B5C8_4E32_B208_816384729909"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When he did manage to approach her, he tripped over his tongue.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Again and again he "
"talked to her, and again and again he stumbled."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando riusciva ad avvicinarsi a lei, inciampava sulle sue stesse parole.⟪k:1⟫Balbettava "
"ogni volta che provava a parlarle."

#: scenario:scenario_EA508B09_5827_459B_B5C9_F5AF66CFEEC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82370be75faac89910fd70da7dbba180dd0bbe2d84f2a6e79971acf0782dc433
#. default-sha256: c12280971a1c462c64f4cb67b9a672eb1d8b87d3b675dd32d719a6d8387d4477
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EA508B09_5827_459B_B5C9_F5AF66CFEEC3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine, if you were to take him to see a romance at the theatre in his present state, he "
"would cry just as much as little Nellie."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Credo che se lo avessero portato a vedere una storia d’amore al teatro nello stato in cui si "
"trovava, avrebbe pianto tanto quanto la piccola Nellie."

#: scenario:scenario_2AF0A793_6732_4EA1_B1BA_593CA607E647
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4ad5ec6e3f1b132c43b83df6b87711766b889132324264469b6dfabf4b82c57
#. default-sha256: 143e4aad5479e128c8da6e8ed4a5752d0b2e875d003fe5be3f658fe56a25cd94
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2AF0A793_6732_4EA1_B1BA_593CA607E647"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We cry at tragedies because we draw parallels with our own lives.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At least, that is "
"what I think."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Piangiamo alle tragedie perché tracciamo un parallelo con le nostre vite.⟪k:1⟫ Almeno, "
"questo è ciò che penso."

#: scenario:scenario_0D975C78_27AC_402B_BC20_D506FE836692
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f4f8e4a02af047089e63e1790f5b527972bf3e78c6ed11a23977e38daaa16b1
#. default-sha256: 5a50bced53d0c84263c070a9cb851329890b396debda740ba60761c7c069f6fd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0D975C78_27AC_402B_BC20_D506FE836692"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Great tales of romance attain true gravity with the audience only when they are personally "
"familiar with love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le grandi storie d’amore raggiungono la massima profondità con il pubblico solo quando "
"quest’ultimo conosce l’amore molto bene."

#: scenario:scenario_06EFB4F0_E9DB_4947_9E6D_EC9DD52A8803
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bac01000baceee14350fbc5dac9f9aa4cbfcacea68c37755cb43524d03011ad
#. default-sha256: 30db0ad3a2c5a37b7802861fa40a586af0464b69243f263c920dd895b33b1bd9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_06EFB4F0_E9DB_4947_9E6D_EC9DD52A8803"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In any event, the White-Haired Girl was, as a result of this, visibly perturbed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ad ogni modo, a causa del comportamento di Mell, la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi era "
"visibilmente turbata."

#: scenario:scenario_A40B3A53_2E10_4AE9_9906_5D3260514FE3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea28e460b6dfb886ad56a417f9aa10fe3867e61295b37b0d43c782a8fa9ebfa8
#. default-sha256: bce5e7dbfb90052ef1c1ecb79b0efac00cf654ba7ae3e01957e6535b07c6b8f8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A40B3A53_2E10_4AE9_9906_5D3260514FE3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was delighted that he was being so kind to her, but confusion overpowered every other "
"emotion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era contenta che lui fosse così gentile con lei, ma la confusione aveva sopraffatto ogni "
"altra emozione."

#: scenario:scenario_E92AD7F5_DDA7_4F31_A873_BB1B2D85E22E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56c64fd3782c93ebe0c63be5e3f4629318eeae5915326315653053667a6d8da0
#. default-sha256: 9bafe281cefb859c86587fa0d83dce4dcde4c61f41da3afc3da1f6c906a68c5c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E92AD7F5_DDA7_4F31_A873_BB1B2D85E22E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She appeared to be at a loss for what to do as he clumsily catapulted words and stares at "
"her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sembrava incerta su cosa fare mentre Mell, goffamente, la ricopriva di parole e di sguardi."

#: scenario:scenario_11CAD9EE_62C5_4140_B892_8B13BF254B82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c08500115091528674ddc60223c527debad81e364ff36aeae1f0e3ae40fa0c3f
#. default-sha256: c14e7c03fc6e2daca96d6b0772375a1253d98210cfa0c2ab56e23f3f5a155bf2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_11CAD9EE_62C5_4140_B892_8B13BF254B82"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But Mell did not back down—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫though he probably knew not what ⟪k:3⟫caused⟪k:4⟫ such "
"fiery emotion to erupt from within his breast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma lui non si tirava indietro—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫anche se probabilmente non sapeva ⟪k:3⟫cos’era⟪k:4⟫ "
"a provocargli un’emozione così ardente da scaldargli il cuore."

#: scenario:scenario_18088729_EA9E_41E2_8B08_FD30C887B732
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b3ca5569563922d8ff366a0abf65530c30f68f022421145e4f7f7a4d7dcee29
#. default-sha256: c4e7a9f844a8a2785519ab349f47970e2455ea3e1e39464371d9508627b5ef8d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_18088729_EA9E_41E2_8B08_FD30C887B732"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One’s first love, in particular, tends to burn like a wildfire.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you familiar "
"with the sensation, Master?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il primo amore, in particolare, tende a bruciare come un incendio.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Conosce questa "
"sensazione, Padrone?"

#: scenario:scenario_D35FE190_0FD7_4935_AF30_325B9163FF7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d34184648c526a20d02d181af34e9e927c64e4b3a8823272dde1ec96bf417d7
