msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ah..."

#: scenario:scenario_0064EE85_B55F_4F23_BFFE_56AA12E5CDD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34e3eaeec15e1f93bf5bc405ba6d7775b51eb1de3bcb5bcd20d38d722c79f25f
