msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5CBE2DE6_446B_4749_B4EA_A3A5775DE1F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the girl did not like the outside world.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There were lots of scary things "
"out there, after all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, alla ragazza non piaceva il mondo esterno.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dopotutto, c’erano molte cose "
"spaventose là fuori."

#: scenario:scenario_968DE948_AA2E_4701_A939_A2785F7CEE19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03a5b573ce4fe9a2093ff53dab1f0c38ef1579acc4c9ee45884d0d81be51a540
#. default-sha256: 0bb8117f63c8ca6288117dde4b814a8304104d17006296ed438696f9839b682c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_968DE948_AA2E_4701_A939_A2785F7CEE19"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though she may have been all alone in the mansion,⟪k:1⟫she grew comfortable with the "
"darkness in time,⟪k:2⟫so she had nothing to be afraid of."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Anche se era tutta sola nella villa,⟪k:1⟫col tempo cominciò a sentirsi a suo agio "
"nell’oscurità,⟪k:2⟫per cui non aveva nulla da temere."

#: scenario:scenario_32F8D57D_8DD9_4FAF_9874_D376DAE271A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
