msgid "⟪k:0⟫You’re doing fine. Keep going.⟪k:1⟫What happens next?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Vai alla grande. Continua.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Cos’è successo dopo?"

#: scenario:scenario_2E56EF2D_57B0_499F_B806_64AAED789BC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
