msgid "⟪k:0⟫Okay..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Va bene..."

#: scenario:scenario_5DD066D5_F911_4923_8D23_5AFFFF403A43
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c20558800239ba92a56f30e7e634bd8a6ecff22d8de9ce12ada595bc86261125
#. default-sha256: 6421b11d5077243e3d44e46b0030ec0d8ec48f2ccb6a59faab6b1b0efff98629
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5DD066D5_F911_4923_8D23_5AFFFF403A43"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then, the girl grew up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E poi, la ragazza diventò adulta."

#: scenario:scenario_3ABF5463_D001_4F4A_A6C9_1C2026CFA592
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f4a8c862042bfcdfeb50256687bbd5a0a26e7cfd9a2efd5096727437d400698
#. default-sha256: 36bb3b70cfa5c8c868685572a3f6475d913b9f6f6b20040aaed63a60bbcd776e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3ABF5463_D001_4F4A_A6C9_1C2026CFA592"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫By then, she had already forgotten why she was locked up.⟪k:1⟫But she was content with the "
"darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A quel punto, aveva già dimenticato il motivo per cui era stata rinchiusa. Ma si "
"accontentava dell’oscurità."

#: scenario:scenario_75F3E623_5F82_40D5_9D38_FBAA6F03E566
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59b766f122c95f998f183e0563d913dbfa22d2a59e1257f2c1b28c438684e833
#. default-sha256: 3e93f73b8aa70c34bb03fcb1aad879b974650363188c4127178763018e68bc78
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_75F3E623_5F82_40D5_9D38_FBAA6F03E566"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, her eyes couldn’t help but be drawn to the little bit of light that spilled through "
"the one window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, i suoi occhi non potevano fare a meno di essere attratti dal piccolo raggio di "
"luce che filtrava attraverso quell’unica finestra."

#: scenario:scenario_A1CE68A2_61F6_4F65_ABFC_0CB2CA4A3E84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e4ec6d770e9486d4864322964e0d6a49135b16102b2cc105bdede967c045486
#. default-sha256: 566ad940b25db8eb3b222482135a2ffb2d88909b4d2728e8e795070d121a94e6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A1CE68A2_61F6_4F65_ABFC_0CB2CA4A3E84"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though she was comfortable in the darkness, the sight of the light made her heart race."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sebbene fosse a suo agio immersa nel buio,⟪k:1⟫la vista della luce le faceva tremare il "
"cuore."

#: scenario:scenario_C81E3409_A993_4D5C_9C3D_6A9C97AD8171
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5d6505ddbaa4eee52a314ba2178c25eb54f5dfd6741f800d72474e9969115fe
#. default-sha256: 9af556c9171e0c5bc1b31409ace1bbb79b5857396e177e9ca17e2fc96c36e032
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C81E3409_A993_4D5C_9C3D_6A9C97AD8171"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At first, the girl thought it was because she found it unpleasant.⟪k:1⟫Because she disliked "
"the light, and the outside.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫But slowly she came to realize..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Inizialmente, la ragazza pensava che dipendesse dal fatto che la trovasse sgradevole—⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫dal fatto che non amasse né la luce, né il⟪k:3⟫mondo esterno.⟪k:4⟫ Ma col tempo, si rese "
"conto..."

#: scenario:scenario_7C3F21D2_96F0_4230_AECB_D134EDD86581
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41a337f097453e49f224f01600218daacfe4c99721ed66a634e0b929fe351017
#. default-sha256: a7e9e7a0d8ea1f8e11ad95dd5e7af193c980b78af0bb2391a4a8c15777076367
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7C3F21D2_96F0_4230_AECB_D134EDD86581"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫that she was curious about the outside world."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫di essere curiosa di vedere cosa c’era oltre quelle mura."

#: scenario:scenario_0BDEAF15_C627_4CAD_B87A_AAEA6E7F867C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29f7083e242c32114b5df4a284b634999f6ac857bd5f01fe29bca7374da2cb2e
#. default-sha256: 37d6c9add4297be56b34e8c677e6cef204317d93addedbad7aef48c4d4b22b53
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0BDEAF15_C627_4CAD_B87A_AAEA6E7F867C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What could be happening out there?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫“Cosa starà succedendo là fuori?”⟪k:1⟫—pensava."

#: scenario:scenario_9A21B5F7_B0D2_4077_979B_BAA779AA217A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b89bcc5702f91ce78b40f02af9b6a8460060d2d88417644fff62b3b53307444b
#. default-sha256: 236ccab3c02feab868ead8569dea2b52438bf31631bbf3eff685c370d2603335
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9A21B5F7_B0D2_4077_979B_BAA779AA217A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For all she knew, the town, the forest, the people, all of it could have changed while she "
"was imprisoned in the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Per quanto ne sapeva, la città, la foresta, le persone...⟪k:1⟫ tutto poteva aver subito dei "
"cambiamenti, mentre era rimasta imprigionata nella villa,"

#: scenario:scenario_56598AB9_8974_4EB1_91E2_584F878B7EFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8727f32551dc67fbf646b179b8c131ac47af6ef09b7076f4a06466773d099df1
