#: scenario:scenario_CBCA5402_8EE5_449C_8D2C_307F99545DA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80dca2fa86fe7ea89d90029551a4f8dc02ea6cec3e2d7f2a993c980aade9e282
#. default-sha256: dc8c1297ca1d9a30581fc59eab5599b008fd3c6717a376b943da48b0c71a7878
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CBCA5402_8EE5_449C_8D2C_307F99545DA5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So the girl decided to write letters and throw them out the window."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Così la ragazza decise di scrivere delle lettere e lanciarle fuori dalla finestra."

#: scenario:scenario_AF0547E0_2202_43F4_8CB8_701330F35362
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 244857fc5b4ab85e638f363857b36bef8c8722c43cce78e13b353912eacce3c3
#. default-sha256: c1befa942018accbb8837f5075bdbbff2f6d323902bead006818b2ab1ab52173
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_AF0547E0_2202_43F4_8CB8_701330F35362"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What began as empty grasping became routine, continuing for several months until she was "
"finally ready to give up. ⟪k:1⟫But then, a beautiful white dove flew in through the window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quello che inizialmente era soltanto un gesto vano, divenne presto⟪k:1⟫una routine. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Continuò per diversi mesi, finchè non arrivò al punto da rinunciare. ⟪k:3⟫Ma un giorno, una bella "
"colomba bianca volò attraverso la finestra."

#: scenario:scenario_B47548E6_0E8F_4E36_9FDC_DE0C47D1DEBC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f84d953ff5e0fba544ff26c72f67ddb90df0634c94d5c1d5744064897050b71
#. default-sha256: e0562153131094e31230a50f544c311c00d3de2a7124f9878d2a6da1bc3f0cbf
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B47548E6_0E8F_4E36_9FDC_DE0C47D1DEBC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Tied to the dove’s leg was a letter.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Her heart racing, she read "
"the words contained within.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It seemed to have been written by a man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Legata alla sua zampa c’era una lettera.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Col cuore che le "
"batteva, la ragazza lesse le parole contenute all’interno.⟪k:7⟫ Sembravano essere state scritte "
"da un uomo."

#: scenario:scenario_5D40A3C0_D6F8_4C03_845D_28CA0562CDA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bafaefe1b2bcbbc4ff95baefbd15ccdae63337248c9f2df7bb60b05644eeb443
#. default-sha256: 219e27e6b5502729085614437cda488c759e7fabfc46e8a1c12a1fa1a3acf30a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5D40A3C0_D6F8_4C03_845D_28CA0562CDA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The letter contained numerous questions for the girl.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It also said that if she "
"attached her reply to the dove, it would bring the letter back to him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La lettera conteneva numerose domande dirette alla ragazza.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Diceva anche che se "
"avesse attaccato la sua risposta alla colomba, questa gli avrebbe riportato la lettera."

#: scenario:scenario_88A1B4A4_544C_4C3D_9D98_E4A5630AB3FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5262e9025cc83a96ae2959a2ef65bf0cdfeaaa4447f26d831c30e030275076c1
#. default-sha256: 043e6e1fe12f5e45b54c9e7e8c94d68b1c5d7bb38f37e251ca0f2f6a8e9c26f0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_88A1B4A4_544C_4C3D_9D98_E4A5630AB3FA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was astonished, but she wrote him back anyway, taking care not to mention where she was."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era sbalordita, ma lei gli scrisse comunque,⟪k:1⟫facendo attenzione a non menzionare dove si "
"trovava."

#: scenario:scenario_1766F330_557F_424C_8EC4_78EB2B10E402
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7782b8fc3200c38b718488868cd2109f1500da6c44a1cdebcff2bc951ccce977
#. default-sha256: 06dd8a919f6d4a8203480e51b89725afefbc942717bf16ccee4fcd5206f9721c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1766F330_557F_424C_8EC4_78EB2B10E402"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After having exchanged letters a number of times, the two felt very close to one another—"
"⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫as though they had known each other for many years, despite having never met."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dopo essersi scambiati lettere per del tempo, i due cominciarono a sentirsi molto vicini "
"l’uno all’altra—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫come se si conoscessero da molti anni, nonostante non si fossero mai "
"incontrati."

#: scenario:scenario_E1D084C7_359D_451B_BB8F_83B19A632203
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71c1778bbc385695921dd1298875750757e6ac8f0dd61a3a81b5dfd12dbe7ddd
#. default-sha256: 79599d5a8bb1e30d86109d79b2a6dc516afcfbaa7ddcb90e5f85e22b52c301e8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E1D084C7_359D_451B_BB8F_83B19A632203"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And eventually, the man..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E alla fine, l’uomo..."

#: scenario:scenario_75974E12_E17D_44D9_BEB4_06B56661AFD3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83f67c707bfe4a4afd0f5f932ee01fe6369209d651c005f475d7bdd496c345ea
#. default-sha256: e4f2162251a3b783c5a34553ce8cd1a2a745eef5ede966683bc383852109f05f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_75974E12_E17D_44D9_BEB4_06B56661AFD3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Said he wanted to meet her?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Disse di volerla incontrare?"

#: scenario:scenario_F0AB2136_BF32_4302_8F9B_F4A2D8DCC0C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a2e644c62f0c43982f1bf3937cfc5cc8a41fa092bf580173f0e06211f47d7ed
