msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F0AB2136_BF32_4302_8F9B_F4A2D8DCC0C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Indeed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Esatto."

#: scenario:scenario_CF942B2A_8573_4AC4_8405_038F9ECDAAF3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c79566ebd242966303a93e49311a00f91a83b4bc5819b74c6b4ed43a63935dc1
#. default-sha256: 4d1cca74e064372d80e9288a41a4a23935bd7d7386992060e917007ca8cec6a9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CF942B2A_8573_4AC4_8405_038F9ECDAAF3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The girl was unsure what to do.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Should she tell him of how she lived?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Should she reveal where she spent her days?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La ragazza non sapeva cosa fare.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Doveva dirgli il modo in cui viveva?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Doveva rivelare dove trascorreva le sue giornate?"

#: scenario:scenario_F39C6EB2_6A99_4340_8145_03CBE6A4C640
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 661776f16d21cfe527b0b34e48dd44d69be541aed25850d5b40e90240a413521
#. default-sha256: 4ef1aea2fd6d5f6825839cd44da9a13319be34bcfb131a4ef8f53324922ac52d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F39C6EB2_6A99_4340_8145_03CBE6A4C640"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was afraid if she did, he would cease to send her letters."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Aveva paura che se lo avesse fatto,⟪k:1⟫l’uomo avrebbe smesso di mandarle le sue lettere."

#: scenario:scenario_EAADD9F5_3290_45CC_A62C_B6CE975B63F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4981f7d78e3597bde0b048505e30ba1d720827e6d8400d65b1b2bfe91f70b6d0
#. default-sha256: fa70b33499b2d99a9992830ad8590bde684e98af81163fbc7d56d3a163a8102c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EAADD9F5_3290_45CC_A62C_B6CE975B63F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was sure he believed her to be a young lady of noble blood..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era sicura che lui avesse creduto che lei fosse una giovane donna di sangue nobile..."

#: scenario:scenario_5EF1B95C_1B1B_463B_9ABE_95212015F172
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d7ab75ff7366276adcf8e498f65ef9470672906f8f1008613f48016df2eaf3e
