msgctxt "scenario:scenario_928C667F_86C1_4B66_ADEB_36C1B7B5ACE0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The girl could not bring herself to write a response.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She released the dove through "
"the window with nothing attached to its leg."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La ragazza non ebbe il coraggio di scrivere alcuna risposta.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Liberò la colomba "
"senza attaccare nulla alla sua zampa."

#: scenario:scenario_FE4A3FA0_4026_4F08_BB0B_929B103BE1BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d1341b303a71f30ef2b897cdbd0ddea10f71126c31c5c6bf98da09b70d99594
#. default-sha256: 42ad64444292959b810615ac3067a74574e6db4f75b0efe8570f4cd127bfa57f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FE4A3FA0_4026_4F08_BB0B_929B103BE1BA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And yet, it returned with another letter, written in the man’s familiar hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eppure, questa ritornò con un’altra lettera,⟪k:1⟫scritta nella familiare calligrafia "
"dell’uomo."

#: scenario:scenario_486710B2_855A_4584_B7B1_3C0290E38AF5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69034bab193c52944ebb0862681807a7e7979e523c266bbe7e26d20ce495e435
#. default-sha256: f12596c17c533ce9744e8035a6aad9ab5355a7dcdc7fdbb66222c5da4a4d4c75
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_486710B2_855A_4584_B7B1_3C0290E38AF5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You must surely have a grave reason for your silence,” it said.⟪k:1⟫“I would like to know "
"that reason, and I would like to help you.⟪k:2⟫No matter what it may be, you have my word.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Dev’esserci sicuramente una ragione importante dietro il vostro silenzio”, disse. ⟪k:1⟫“Mi "
"piacerebbe sapere questa ragione, e potervi aiutare.⟪k:2⟫Non importa quale questa possa essere, "
"avete la mia parola.”"

#: scenario:scenario_4243FE58_99FC_4669_A108_6D091AF1DA94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17d3dd15a50a9ccf0c70c77d6d4d17f6e07f10d8064d35342a63154a4bc4fbfd
#. default-sha256: d10863e2d0f9bc23e6421cb76f5cb8fb7c9fd8a7acaf6983ea910cbec6c170e0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4243FE58_99FC_4669_A108_6D091AF1DA94"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She deliberated.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Though his letters were kind, she did not know this man.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"He was from the outside.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Would he still treat her the same way when he met her?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lei rifletté.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sebbene le lettere dell’uomo fossero gentili, non lo conosceva.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫Apparteneva al mondo esterno.⟪k:5⟫ L’avrebbe trattata allo stesso modo⟪k:6⟫qualora l’avesse "
"incontrata?"

#: scenario:scenario_8F5608BB_5BDA_4C1A_902E_F3B51D02EDA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 141c8369c964d6ad4869783ca3ee714b6e5fbbe9d327c5c48a93af070202c5fd
#. default-sha256: ee336a4862b5226df51417358cc6571c74e44fd6b9619e2877e73adb3836bd97
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8F5608BB_5BDA_4C1A_902E_F3B51D02EDA2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And did she even want to step out into the world beyond?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E lei, voleva davvero mettere piede in quel mondo?"

#: scenario:scenario_944EF2BA_DA9A_401C_A94E_33EF98DC569D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57cd5679f0fb23671a1f8e2c745dcd4e7f4eb730021c50f381244461dd7def9e
