msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FE34D9F5_4D42_4880_AD4E_25D719C40481"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Yes... ⟪k:1⟫she did."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sì... ⟪k:1⟫è proprio ciò che fece."

#: scenario:scenario_B30F22CA_D1C1_45A7_841D_87806D358FFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6fcad63d70fa88dcb648e4ed7baa54a7a6a9aaef5504ae3b9c1579dd4f08cb1
#. default-sha256: e730421c3b541b960ff3d68ffb062073b202d43142299808d4379dc4cd158151
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B30F22CA_D1C1_45A7_841D_87806D358FFE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The girl made up her mind: she would write a letter.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As always, when she tied it to "
"the dove’s leg, it flew off out the window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La ragazza si decise: avrebbe scritto una lettera.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Come al solito, appena la legò "
"alla zampa della colomba,⟪k:3⟫questa volò fuori dalla finestra."

#: scenario:scenario_3D794990_E54F_4FF5_9DBC_04872CCA9198
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eacc5d146dcd3ef6ff8735e7f5dd5f66de6bb3fd3bdf60a70ade8d5ea253f23f
#. default-sha256: 93d69e2b4352812008bddbb55422105d431f90e2d3033c27bb41bcf7983298af
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3D794990_E54F_4FF5_9DBC_04872CCA9198"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And for some time after that, she received no response from the man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E per diverso tempo, non ricevette alcuna risposta da parte dell’uomo."

#: scenario:scenario_848D3012_9678_4CFC_99BA_EDEC88106444
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82a84b71d7e2341c2ca47880e5109a3c1cadbc04e7bf29ea54f48b15423ff6c9
#. default-sha256: 3db9a7aa95e2da906088ecea943b0ca4d0f342a0a8b3624206a4155b1899f80e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_848D3012_9678_4CFC_99BA_EDEC88106444"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This saddened her, but she thought it was for the best.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She belonged in her own "
"confined world, her world of darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ciò la rattristò, ma pensò che fosse meglio così.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In fondo, apparteneva al proprio "
"mondo confinato, immerso nelle tenebre."

#: scenario:scenario_613CCC3A_D218_4D1E_98D4_DED85A7F0C8C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00222a0cee864673374041dd639911492c7c9709d1e2d06dd6ccb80f45d51ef6
#. default-sha256: fcec4d4be02cb0ea9cc7c6a816dbaeb3b067dc0a53b3fc71f67b500f63f56709
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_613CCC3A_D218_4D1E_98D4_DED85A7F0C8C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But then one day, light shone into the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma poi un giorno, la luce illuminò la villa."

#: scenario:scenario_67BBB3B7_1859_4B86_B245_05544EEF75D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 100c633d8416924b2b779b7d6718c24b56ea85fd3917c862c055166b88840e81
