msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The sealed door had been opened, and in the doorway stood a handsome "
"young man. ⟪k:5⟫“I have come for you,” he said."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫La porta sigillata si era aperta, e sulla soglia c’era un bel giovane."
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“Sono venuto per voi”, disse."

#: scenario:scenario_587D24C8_0F1A_4CA3_BEEE_FA016552CD02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1033461f885c5576236fe754e91ecca0ff8806dfefa416c0573335e67d29e9a
#. default-sha256: 375711d00fb3b3ddd1bcabce14226d1b69fe270a6014de86c61d57ac5c5f61ce
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_587D24C8_0F1A_4CA3_BEEE_FA016552CD02"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man was a prince from a neighboring kingdom. ⟪k:1⟫When the girl stepped outside, before "
"her sat a magnificent carriage—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the likes of which she had never before seen—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"accompanied by many servants."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’uomo era il principe di un regno vicino. ⟪k:1⟫Quando la ragazza uscì,⟪k:2⟫vide davanti a "
"sé una magnifica carrozza—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫bella come non ne aveva mai viste—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫scortata da molti "
"servitori."

#: scenario:scenario_85008DAE_7D90_4D84_B7E9_08E84D3F21A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3669ad9b42f5e9296e20124536e258ed04f5f8dcae0c69b64ef4027e9e10e96e
#. default-sha256: ffc3996315dc307ed23fb4940a90ac58fa4309006525076c65209e49b118fcb5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_85008DAE_7D90_4D84_B7E9_08E84D3F21A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The prince, kind as in the letters, swore his love to her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il principe, gentile come nelle lettere, le giurò il proprio amore."

#: scenario:scenario_EA4B82A1_1752_42A7_9AF9_2C915D3DBD06
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b93a8982350df14790b6bbda88e5059cabc596fd3f7a550a69186dee433c4f1f
