msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Um, ⟪k:2⟫was there something funny about the story?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ehm, ⟪k:2⟫c’era qualcosa di buffo nel racconto?"

#: scenario:scenario_B951A655_EE3A_4723_8807_184E884F62A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9a68c9b4762485ae92d3346188ba196994d88c4c25523d02ac36a71edd591f7
