msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It doesn’t have to be a real prince—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫even just someone ⟪k:4⟫like⟪k:5⟫ one.⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫Is that something you dream about?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non deve essere per forza un vero e proprio principe—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫basta qualcuno che "
"gli ⟪k:5⟫somigli⟪k:6⟫.⟪k:7⟫ Lo vorresti?"

#: scenario:scenario_B828E736_B3A3_46BE_9F5A_3AFC624AA3E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac2368edbacac0525318cae8399d4ffb048fdbb056fcbbf08afd7c2a727fe83e
#. default-sha256: 40d447c2f9fe154d6aab7965bc7043711bf95d738a5afc12d0e65abf4cbeaeeb
