msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, ⟪k:2⟫no, ⟪k:3⟫um...⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I think I’m... ⟪k:6⟫perhaps a little too old for that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah, ⟪k:2⟫ecco, ⟪k:3⟫io...⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Penso... ⟪k:6⟫di non essere più così giovane per "
"queste cose."

#: scenario:scenario_429C3B75_9295_4AF5_9F6A_262D3D40401D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76c5a08a4f97097b2a73f83d9deec60ca53878924597cc4593fb4bf95e747db8
#. default-sha256: 7c9ccd9b7b091bc28896d3ae358b13050e6f13af636c6475116c21babf5f317d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_429C3B75_9295_4AF5_9F6A_262D3D40401D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You think so? Nellie still fantasizes about her prince, and she’s fourteen. ⟪k:2⟫I just "
"assumed all girls were the same."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tu dici?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Nellie continua a fantasticare sul suo principe, e ha quattordici "
"anni.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ho solo pensato che le ragazze fossero tutte uguali."

#: scenario:scenario_38480F75_6114_4D0C_B895_14D4970A440F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad91bcf46fc34e7334455b463449d27947581af1b8599de10ed1df70d1396751
